GAP-14: TeamInvitationStatus union now includes 'revoked'. Added
revokeInvitation(input) and resendInvitation(input) to TeamService.
Both enforce business isolation and emit team.invitation.revoked /
team.invitation.created sync events. Added RevokeInvitationInput and
ResendInvitationInput types.

GAP-15: enforceSubscriptionForSync now throws SubscriptionWarning
instead of calling console.warn when within grace period — respects
ANPAS no-logging-in-production rule.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
