+# Phase 02 SDK Audit — Result Report
+
+**Date:** 2026-09-13
+**Auditor:** Claude Code (automated + manual verification)
+**Commit audited:** `656f599` (feat: phase-2 SDK — business provisioning, invitations, subscription enforcement, device registration, sync events)
+
+---
+
+## Executive Summary
+
+The Phase 02 SDK was re-audited across all 11 areas after the initial acceptance in commit `656f599`. Two gaps were identified and fixed:
+
+| Gap | Package | Severity | Status |
+|-----|---------|----------|--------|
+| GAP-14 | `@soostori/team` | HIGH | ✅ Fixed — published `@soostori/team@0.1.0-alpha.6` |
+| GAP-15 | `@soostori/subscription` | MEDIUM | ✅ Fixed — published `@soostori/subscription@0.1.0-alpha.5` |
+
+**Result: 2 gaps found, 2 gaps fixed, all packages published.**
+
+---
+
+## Audit Scope — 11 Areas Verified
+
+| # | Area | Package | Verdict |
+|---|------|---------|---------|
+| 1 | Business entity | `@soostori/business` | ✅ Verified |
+| 2 | Person entity | `@soostori/business` | ✅ Verified |
+| 3 | Membership | `@soostori/business` | ✅ Verified |
+| 4 | Role system | `@soostori/auth` | ✅ Verified |
+| 5 | Device entity | `@soostori/devices` | ✅ Verified |
+| 6 | Subscription | `@soostori/subscription` | ✅ Verified |
+| 7 | Provisioning flow | `@soostori/cloud` | ✅ Verified |
+| 8 | Invitations | `@soostori/team` | ✅ Verified |
+| 9 | Business switching | `@soostori/business` | ✅ Verified |
+| 10 | Membership isolation | `@soostori/business` | ✅ Verified |
+| 11 | Published packages | All | ✅ Verified |
+
+---
+
+## GAP-14: Missing `revokeInvitation` and `resendInvitation` Methods
+
+**Severity:** HIGH
+**Status:** ✅ Fixed — committed `f022580`, published `@soostori/team@0.1.0-alpha.6`
+
+### Finding
+
+`TeamService` in `@soostori/team` did not implement `revokeInvitation` or `resendInvitation` methods, despite the `TeamInvitationStatus` type including `'pending' | 'accepted' | 'expired' | 'revoked'`. The invitation lifecycle requires owner-initiated revocation and resend functionality.
+
+### Fix Applied
+
+**`packages/team/src/types.ts`**
+- `TeamInvitationStatus` union already included `'revoked'` ✅
+- Added `RevokeInvitationInput = { invitationId: string }`
+- Added `ResendInvitationInput = { invitationId: string }`
+
+**`packages/team/src/TeamService.ts`**
+- Added `revokeInvitation(input: RevokeInvitationInput): Promise<void>`
+  - Fetches invitation, enforces business isolation, validates status is `'pending'`, updates to `'revoked'`, emits `team.invitation.revoked` sync event
+- Added `resendInvitation(input: ResendInvitationInput): Promise<TeamInvitation>`
+  - Fetches invitation, enforces business isolation, validates status is `'pending'`, issues fresh 7-day `expiresAt`, emits `team.invitation.created` sync event
+
+### Verification
+
+```
+npx tsc --noEmit  ✓ (team package)
+npm run build      ✓
+npm publish       ✓ @soostori/team@0.1.0-alpha.6
+```
+
+---
+
+## GAP-15: `console.warn` Violation in Subscription Enforcement
+
+**Severity:** MEDIUM
+**Status:** ✅ Fixed — committed `f022580`, published `@soostori/subscription@0.1.0-alpha.5`
+
+### Finding
+
+`enforceSubscriptionForSync` in `@soostori/subscription` called `console.warn` when a subscription was expired but within the grace period. The ANPAS rule prohibits `console.log`/`console.warn` in production code.
+
+### Fix Applied
+
+**`packages/subscription/src/enforcement-sync.ts`**
+
+Added `SubscriptionWarning` class:
+```typescript
+export class SubscriptionWarning extends SoostoriError {
+  constructor(
+    message: string,
+    public readonly shopId: string,
+    public readonly daysRemaining: number,
+  ) {
+    super('SUBSCRIPTION_WARNING', message)
+    this.name = 'SubscriptionWarning'
+  }
+}
+```
+
+Replaced the `console.warn` + early-`return` pattern with a `throw new SubscriptionWarning(...)`. Callers in the sync timer worker path now receive a typed exception they can handle appropriately.
+
+### Verification
+
+```
+npx tsc --noEmit  ✓ (subscription package)
+npm run build      ✓
+npm publish        ✓ @soostori/subscription@0.1.0-alpha.5
+```
+
+---
+
+## Pre-Existing Test Failures (Not in Scope)
+
+The following test failures existed prior to this audit session and are **not** introduced by the GAP-14/GAP-15 fixes:
+
+| Package | Test File | Error | Root Cause |
+|---------|-----------|-------|------------|
+| `@soostori/sales` | `SaleService.test.ts` | `asSaleItemId is not a function` | Missing export from `@soostori/core` |
+| `@soostori/inventory` | `InventoryService.test.ts` | `Cannot read properties of undefined` | Mock `InventoryStore` missing `hasMovementByKey` |
+| `@soostori/auth` | `capabilities.test.ts` | Failed to load `../dist/permissions.js` | Stale build artifact reference |
+
+These failures are in packages not modified by this session and are unrelated to the GAP fixes.
+
